**Mutations.** They were run against scratch copies of the repository layout (symlinked ui/ and docs/, mutated matrix copy) by `build/design-evidence/a11y/verify-r2-1/mutate.py`:
- unmutated copy: exit 0;
- unknown tier ('mandatory'): exit 1;
- source id not in the table (PER-BIRCH99): exit 1;
- a referenced source row deleted: exit 1;
- safety row 24 demoted to setting, tier only: exit 1;
- safety row 24 demoted with a consistent axis edit: exit 1;
- keyboard-filter safety row 65 demoted consistently: exit 1;
- vestibular row 29 untagged, demoted and given a motion axis: exit 1.

**Known limit confirmed.** Non-safety baseline row 62 (full keyboard operation) demoted with a consistent axis edit exits 0. check.py documents this as a known limit; it is reported as a minor finding. The real matrix was never edited.

status_claims:
**Prototype.** All 46 works and partial cells were checked by script: every selector, attribute, custom property, ARIA token and quoted string was grepped in ui/design/system, and every cited line number was checked to exist and be non-empty. The only miss was `[data-density]`, which exists as `[data-density="compact"]` (tokens.css 45, components.css 156).

The three works cells were confirmed by hand:
- **Row 32:** components.css 355–364 designs the static forms.
- **Row 40:** Inter at tokens.css line 23. The only weights in tokens and components are 400 and 600 (the 100 is the @font-face range). There is no italic or font-style anywhere.
- **Row 57:** --space-target-min 24px at tokens.css line 46, applied at components.css 49, 80 and 95. .ds-check and .ds-radio also meet 24 px, .ds-window-ctl is 40 × 32, and the compact 20 px .ds-place is a non-interactive span.

Other cited lines were read and match: tokens.css 80, 88, 124–128, 187, 286 and 427–431; components.css 14, 37, 42–44, 239, 246–247 and 350–381; index.html 2 and 87. No prefers-color-scheme, prefers-contrast, forced-colors or prefers-reduced-transparency mapping exists, as claimed.

**Native.** All 92 cells use a valid value (needs-extension 64, feasible-now 21, future-research 7), and each names a real component, document or contract. The following were checked to exist with matching content:
- SemanticNode in ui/native/src/render.rs (lines 1025–1042);
- controller.rs line 405, render.rs line 438, theme.rs line 58 (wallpaper), and the MATERIAAL and HIGH_CONTRAST palettes;
- design.rs line 71 ('No animation is introduced');
- PROFILES-AND-USERS.md 44–51 (no back buffer, page flip or vsync);
- NATIVE-COMPOSITOR.md line 53;
- TYPOGRAPHY.md 8.4–8.6 and the italic rule (F12 and line 655);
- CAPABILITY-MATRIX dependency 20 'Accessibility service' (U04 open);
- FR-S03, D2, services/input-core, both text.rs files, drivers/virtio-snd and NATIVE-FEASIBILITY.md.

Extensions are recorded separately in section 10. No contract file changed.
